#: ../../source/docs/common-airvolute-DroneCore-Suite.rst:40
#: e07c265799374313869df60e7d0c4215
msgid "DroneCore.Suite comes with both Cube and Xavier NX pre-configured and communicating together and able to control a Multicopter. Developers no longer need to solve basic communication and compatibility issues coming from connecting two different IT worlds. It They can start to concentrate on their application needs from the beginning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-airvolute-DroneCore-Suite.rst:42
#: b43f145682e74efaa3fcbc77a6a31274
msgid "Accompanying documentation provides a fast learning curve to start using various peripherals to control the drone and create the desired application. Various software libraries (coming soon) further enrich the possibilities for the developer relieving them from complex configuration and programming tasks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-airvolute-DroneCore-Suite.rst:45
#: 615f17c9911e4d03a3c627a77b27c03c
